{
 "_how_to_add": "Add a company: copy one line, change name/ats/token. ats is one of greenhouse, lever, ashby, personio, smartrecruiters, recruitee, workable. token is the company's name in its job-board address (boards.greenhouse.io/TOKEN, jobs.lever.co/TOKEN, jobs.ashbyhq.com/TOKEN, TOKEN.jobs.personio.de, jobs.smartrecruiters.com/TOKEN, TOKEN.recruitee.com, apply.workable.com/TOKEN). Set \"off\": true to pause a source. Events: type ics (a calendar file), html (a list page; set link_pattern) or auto (any page: Mirror finds calendar files, embedded event data or a news feed by itself). uni is the university code (FU, HU, TU, UDK, CHA, HTW, BHT, HWR, ASH, HFM, KHB, EHB, KHSB …) or all. \"review\": true keeps a source's events in Review feed; \"auto\": true posts even events read from a plain web page.",
